tion timeouts, multiple printers, and OS-level permission differences.\n\n**Phase 5 — Compatibility & Validation**\n- Test across Chrome, Firefox, Edge on Windows, macOS, and Linux (QZ Tray behavior varies by OS).\n- Verify printed output: text alignment, font legibility, barcode/QR scanability, and correct line truncation at 58mm / 80mm widths.\n- Confirm that existing **mobile** share flows (WhatsApp, email, image) remain intact and unaffected by the desktop-focused QZ Tray changes.\n- Validate that the settings page correctly saves, loads, and applies the paper size and print method preferences.",
